{"meta":{"id":"tt6418084","type":"series","name":"Carême: Chef de reyes","imdb_id":"tt6418084","description":"Sé testigo del ascenso del primer chef célebre del mundo, Antonin Carême, y su descenso hacia una vida de espionaje en la Francia napoleónica donde la que reina es la manipulación. Con sus dones gastronómicos y de seducción, se convierte en el arma perfecta en la lucha por el poder.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt6418084.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7vUmiPhYSgduTvGfRMZ4SdyTWKl.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZdcjvhoI6RCFg455UdEvK5UtAj.png","genres":["Drama","Misterio","War & Politics"],"releaseInfo":"2025-","released":"2025-04-30T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"France","cast":["Benjamin Voisin","Jérémie Renier","Lyna Khoudri","Sigrid Bouaziz","Alice Da Luz Gomes","Pablo Cobo","Micha Lescot","Juliette Armanet","Arthur Mazet","Lily Taïeb","Maud Wyler","Dimitri Doré","Clotilde Mollet","Gabriel Donzelli"],"writer":["Davide Serino","Ian Kelly"],"trailers":[{"source":"-d4aZI-S0S0","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"-d4aZI-S0S0","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"-d4aZI-S0S0","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.0","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt6418084"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Misterio","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Misterio"},{"name":"War & Politics","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=War+%26+Politics"},{"name":"Benjamin Voisin","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Benjamin%20Voisin"},{"name":"Jérémie Renier","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?se